# Title: Suspicious Windows Defender Registry Key Tampering Via Reg.EXE
# ID: 452bce90-6fb0-43cc-97a5-affc283139b3
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Florian Roth (Nextron Systems), Swachchhanda Shrawan Poudel, Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2022-03-22
# Tags: attack.defense-impairment, attack.t1685
# Description: Detects the usage of "reg.exe" to tamper with different Windows Defender registry keys in order to disable some important features related to protection and detection
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((((process_name:*\\reg.exe) OR (OriginalFileName:"reg.exe")) AND ((cmdline:*SOFTWARE\\Microsoft\\Windows Defender\\* OR cmdline:*SOFTWARE\\Policies\\Microsoft\\Windows Defender Security Center* OR cmdline:*SOFTWARE\\Policies\\Microsoft\\Windows Defender\\*))) AND (((cmdline:* add * AND cmdline:*d 0*) AND (cmdline:*DisallowExploitProtectionOverride* OR cmdline:*EnableControlledFolderAccess* OR cmdline:*MpEnablePus* OR cmdline:*PUAProtection* OR cmdline:*SpynetReporting* OR cmdline:*SubmitSamplesConsent* OR cmdline:*TamperProtection*)) OR ((cmdline:* add * AND cmdline:*d 1*) AND (cmdline:*DisableAccess* OR cmdline:*DisableAntiSpyware* OR cmdline:*DisableAntiSpywareRealtimeProtection* OR cmdline:*DisableAntiVirus* OR cmdline:*DisableAntiVirusSignatures* OR cmdline:*DisableArchiveScanning* OR cmdline:*DisableBehaviorMonitoring* OR cmdline:*DisableBlockAtFirstSeen* OR cmdline:*DisableCloudProtection* OR cmdline:*DisableConfig* OR cmdline:*DisableEnhancedNotifications* OR cmdline:*DisableIntrusionPreventionSystem* OR cmdline:*DisableIOAVProtection* OR cmdline:*DisableNetworkProtection* OR cmdline:*DisableOnAccessProtection* OR cmdline:*DisablePrivacyMode* OR cmdline:*DisableRealtimeMonitoring* OR cmdline:*DisableRoutinelyTakingAction* OR cmdline:*DisableScanOnRealtimeEnable* OR cmdline:*DisableScriptScanning* OR cmdline:*DisableSecurityCenter* OR cmdline:*Notification_Suppress* OR cmdline:*SignatureDisableUpdateOnStartupWithoutEngine*))))
